From: Bjarne <87858321+bjakra@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 15:23:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Play keybox: verified boot key setting (original / GrapheneOS
 / custom)

KeyboxStore persists the mode as a 0600 no-backup file, resolves it to a
PlayKeybox.BootOverride in-process and passes it to maybeRewrite; the keybox
screen gains a Verified boot key entry with a custom 64-hex option.
---
